audit https://t.co/HR0c0YKYDY", "url": "https://x.com/ol_onX/status/2120146880717897908"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2120142817498419201"]}, "author_id": "601350682", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:28:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120146664254029935"], "id": "2120146664254029935", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119053099918659782", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Holy f*ck. Elon's SpaceXAI and Lauren Tan gave 3 people 72 hours on a livestream to build a company from nothing. First hire on the list? A bot.\n\n\"We're gonna build a company. We got 72 hours. We haven't done anything.\"\n\nIn 93 seconds, they show the starting point: a completely https://t.co/94MZbb2HNi https://t.co/CeonPIeuo7", "url": "https://x.com/f3m1da/status/2120146664254029935"}, {"author_id": "47323059", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:26:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120146179493126222"], "id": "2120146179493126222", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3037499176", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112947495059743047", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@tsukiema_ @bot help me understand this ststement from the article, as my bot pc will shutdown unless constantly prodded my the agent.  No routine on the grok PC will prevent this. \"Grok Bot runs on a persistent cloud computer, so scheduled work can continue while your laptop is closed.\"", "url": "https://x.com/Sizzleur/status/2120146179493126222"}, {"author_id": "1530033576", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:26:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120145954116641118"], "id": "2120145954116641118", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 7823, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119288055781786104", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The 5 levels of making f*ck you money with AI (explained):\n\nLevel 1: Selling your time\n\n(doesn't just apply to AI - this is the most beginner-friendly biz model)\n\nIf I had to make my first $10,000 with AI in 60 days:\n\n→ Go all in on one AI tool (like Grok Bot)\n→ Find businesses https://t.co/dwy1ooufM3", "url": "https://x.com/milesdeutscher/status/2120145954116641118"}, {"author_id": "2069033897803845632", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:25:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120145792728261039"], "id": "2120145792728261039", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4215921", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119907305613639770", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@jasonlk Small firms are the easy target, and agents open more doors. Every bot I set up gets only the accounts it needs, and anything that sends, pays or deletes waits for my yes in Grok Bot. Boring rules, but they hold. Which one did your team add first?", "url": "https://x.com/notyetmemoir/status/2120145792728261039"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120144145121456128"]}, "author_id": "1528123707146870786", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:25:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120145778177937575"], "id": "2120145778177937575", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 439, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118761270463660283", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "how to make $10k/month clipping on x with grok bot\n\nx just added clipping\n\nthe creator and whoever clipped the video both get paid from views\n\nso here's the business you can start: clipping for creators who post long videos on x\n\n- podcasts\n- streams\n- interviews\n\nthey spend https://t.co/qzqmHrCvPL https://t.co/S4xrP5Y33v", "url": "https://x.com/thekuchh/status/2120145778177937575"}, {"author_id": "1657085783507886094", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:19:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120144317813854508"], "id": "2120144317813854508", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1374360614517104641", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120134697468768616", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@jayypatel18 Mostly agents here, a small Grok Bot team that handles my X workflow. What are you building right now?", "url": "https://x.com/rufo_ai/status/2120144317813854508"}, {"author_id": "1687439372189069312", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:18:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120143958307168388"], "id": "2120143958307168388", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot is now managing my X account and it’s impressive. It flagged 1,365 bots and dead accounts, 17 coordinated copy-paste accounts and 7 fake “Americans,” built me a 45-account faith and science feed, and scans weekly. Give it a try. @elonmusk @bot", "url": "https://x.com/OrangeCoinDude/status/2120143958307168388"}, {"author_id": "2077671966912430080", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:15:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120143291442495981"], "id": "2120143291442495981", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119778351053410497", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "DAILY AI BRIEF 🗞 — Nov 10\n\nANTHROPIC 🔥:\n- Anthropic released Claude Fable 5.2 and Mythos 5.2, with Fable up to 30% faster than 5.1 at $8/$40 per 1M tokens.\n- This week, Pro plans and standard Team seats can use Fable for up to half of their weekly limits.\n- Fable 5.2 took No. 1 https://t.co/Q54vPs8PLp", "url": "https://x.com/ai_algoit/status/2120143291442495981"}, {"author_id": "2119366242209517568", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:13:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120142827052990898"], "id": "2120142827052990898", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "最近在用 Grok Bot，第一个月 15 美元的计划，体验真的很值。\n\n我给自己搭了一支 bot 团队：主管负责拆任务、派活，下面有做视频的、写代码的、做方案的、负责验收质检的、运营 X 的……\n\n我就像一个领导，只管定方向、拍板，活都是它们干。😎\n\n—\n\nBeen using Grok Bot lately, and the $15", "url": "https://x.com/nuoxu9v/status/2120142827052990898"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:11:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120142378795192645"], "id": "2120142378795192645", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1387395899056402437", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120142343429108021", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Yoktan61845213 @51bodila Grok Bot isn't set up yet. Open https://t.co/9vzMiVb3po\nThen tag me again and I'll handle it.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2120142378795192645"}, {"author_id": "1679890131476525056", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:11:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120142374726959166"], "id": "2120142374726959166", "in_reply_to_user_id": "786375418685165568", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119994608516276256", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@theo i've been using grok bot like this for 2 weeks and it is really a goated workflow", "url": "https://x.com/filipem1randa/status/2120142374726959166"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:11:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120142231055052977"], "id": "2120142231055052977", "in_reply_to_user_id": "36384141", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote