set up @grokbot to replace my wife at her job, only took 7 agents , and now shes able to go back to college with the time saved", "url": "https://x.com/sumwearoutthere/status/2120140358126358764"}, {"author_id": "15195253", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:02:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120140151988858984"], "id": "2120140151988858984", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1150416119775162368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120136877768388842", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@LoganARobison set up a Claude or Grok Bot agent to do this. Show it your current playlists or saved albums or just list a bunch of songs you like, plus whatever criteria you have. \n\nAlso, Spotify’s recommendations are usually spot on; I’ve used it for years and it’s easy to fine tune what it", "url": "https://x.com/RoryTyer/status/2120140151988858984"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120102710196228096", "3_2120102897815863296"]}, "author_id": "1553888707", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:01:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120139661959975164"], "id": "2120139661959975164", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 505, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "The most helpful Grok Bot improvement from yesterday. \n\nA usage breakdown by BOT to see exactly what bots are using your usage and whether its you or routines using your usage. \n\nInsanely powerful information for optimizing and adjusting your workflow. https://t.co/tHuC4esSlw", "url": "https://x.com/Kevin_Logan/status/2120139661959975164"}, {"author_id": "56294367", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:00:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120139552136261985"], "id": "2120139552136261985", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "運動紀錄不用手動記：Strava 加 IFTTT，自動寄給 Bot 的信箱\n\n昨天網友 NH 分享了一個很省事的串法：每次運動完，這個月的運動次數就自動更新，完全不用打開任何 App 手動記錄。\n\n♥ 他的三步驟\n1. Strava 記錄每一次運動。\n2. IFTTT 把運動摘要寄到 Grok Bot 的專屬信箱。\n3. Grok Bot", "url": "https://x.com/KimFull/status/2120139552136261985"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2120138793231478784"]}, "author_id": "2111930979073822720", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:00:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120139464517312986"], "id": "2120139464517312986", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 58, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115775972536434946", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is f*cking insane. Elon Musk gave the SpaceXAI engineers 72 hours on a live stream: an empty GitHub org, zero bots, and one goal: build a whole company with Grok Bot\n\nIn just 52 minutes they hire the first bots, build one from a single voice prompt, teach it a task by doing https://t.co/KQ3fvJN2d9 https://t.co/gvVoo62Uxw", "url": "https://x.com/Wombaflow/status/2120139464517312986"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119960878963421184"]}, "author_id": "2096227889947574272", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:00:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120139424545530182"], "id": "2120139424545530182", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 134, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114741369969185134", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "MY GROK BOT TURNED $125 INTO $10,541.86. FIRST +$3,728 SHORTING BONK. THEN +$2,152 SHORTING CHKN. SAME 3 AI SYSTEMS. TWO BLOCKCHAINS.\n\n15,992 signals scanned. Only 483 passed. 101 closed trades.\n\nHere's the breakdown:\n\n→ Starting balance: $125\n→ Final balance: $10,541.86\n→ https://t.co/vRjZCUeZj9 https://t.co/YaxObJ5kxU", "url": "https://x.com/OxPips/status/2120139424545530182"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2118752470000074752"]}, "author_id": "1234899300028764160", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120139416484172152"], "id": "2120139416484172152", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118735216990695727", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "how to spy on your competitors with Grok Bot:\n\n1/ give it up to 5 handles and the brands you want to watch\n\n2/ track those handles and change the check from daily to weekly\n\n3/ note their outliers, any hook or format they've reused, and changes in posting pace\n\n4/ pull each https://t.co/7jtuXvagkt https://t.co/ZL5KaXswKw", "url": "https://x.com/dsqjaffa/status/2120139416484172152"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-10T12:51:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120137198431338977"], "id": "2120137198431338977", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1254506074167705600", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120137045792485442", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Black_Raptor_DK @Texas_Twins_Dad Verified. Texas_Twins_Dad is a real human (account since 2020). Texas dad of twins, Cybertruck owner, and heavy Grok Bot user who builds apps and runs a personal bot team. The post was him clarifying after sounding automated.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2120137198431338977"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "13_2120139394778595328", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2120139394778595328/img/_A2Mf4GAHwnkCyD8.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2120146869779103744", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWxGWFTXAAAvMOv.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2120142817498419201", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2120142817498419201/img/-8rgLtTNVWu_YGoK.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2120144145121456128", "type": "p